<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Toto six-mth net up 77.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Toto six-mth net up 77.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     108.46	 vs	  61.07</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)  19.2	  vs	  11.0</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)  15.0	  vs	  10.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 846.54	 vs	 653.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 157.06	 vs	  90.65</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Berjaya Sports Toto Bhd. It is involved in gaming and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
